    5. Draw each frame as a 1-cell-thick border of its color on the grid.
    6. Output is a 2x2 grid of the color whose frame has the larger interior area.
  rejection: retry placement if frames cannot fit with required gap (low rejection for 10x10 grid with frames sized 3-10).
```
